":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1655218/71b18db8-304a-4ae8-89fd-2dc83a3f0cb5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1655218/71b18db8-304a-4ae8-89fd-2dc83a3f0cb5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"❤️ This spacious and modern apartment is perfect for business travelers seeking a home away from home! 🌠\n\nStep into a bright, well-lit space perfect for relaxing or working. The apartment is thoughtfully designed with your comfort in mind, featuring modern furnishings that can comfortably accommodate up to 10 guests. Five serene bedrooms promise restful nights, ensuring everyone feels at home.\n\nThe living area exudes a calm and functional vibe, designed for both relaxation and productivity. Unwind after a day of meetings with your favorite shows on TV. Step into the separate, fully equipped kitchen—a true chef's delight. With modern appliances, including an oven, dishwasher, and a spacious fridge, plus all the necessary cooking supplies, this kitchen makes preparing meals an absolute pleasure. A bright bathroom with a refreshing shower completes this inviting and convenient space, providing the perfect relaxing base for your stay.\n\n📍Location:\nExperience comfort and convenience in this 5-bedroom apartment in Barsbüttel, located on the first floor of a 2-story building. Living in Barsbüttel means enjoying the best of both worlds: a quiet, green, and family-friendly community just outside Hamburg, with excellent schools, local shops, and easy access to the city. Perfect for those who value tranquility without giving up urban convenience.\n\n📩 Reach out today for more information — your new space is waiting for you!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"5"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"180"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":806000,"deposit":400000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"8060.00","deposit":"4000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-03-30"}],"updated":"2026-03-30T10:57:40Z","__utId__":"ut1655218"}]